{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of Ticker Tape is to buy and sell commodities with your friends to see who can be the fattest Wall Street Cat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Speculate</strong> low value stocks will rise to be re-sold for a profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Cry</strong> as the stocks you paid too much for plummet for the second time in one turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview of Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random commodities (Stocks) values are rolled once a round by each Player. They can either go up, down, or pay dividends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once rolling is complete, every player will buy and sell their stocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the chosen amount of turns are complete, the players scores are tallied up to see who is the better 1%er! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game can be customized by the game Host. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to modernize stocks, change time limits, and turn limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options for random events to keep the matches spicy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Steam friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a Quick Play to be put you into an open game</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win one game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668800/3eb7ad49843561e99f1d9f2da4bec195b027998f.jpg"},{"name":"Played 50 games!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668800/069df25a43f22a8c40a2251773d72447db4fad71.jpg"},{"name":"Accumulate $100,000!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668800/8fc0b18c4d40d586719d7cdf83eb27eee7e34867.jpg"},{"name":"Go br